---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import heroImage from '../assets/our-story-hero.webp';
import workshopImage from '../assets/our-story-hero-in-workshop.webp';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---

<Layout
  title="Our Story"
  description="Meet Jukka-Pekka Lilja, the luthier building folk instruments by hand in Karjalohja, Finland, since 2010."
>
  <section class="story-band reveal">
    <div class="container story-band__grid">
      <div class="story-band__image-wrap">
        <Image src={heroImage} alt="Jukka-Pekka Lilja in the luthier workshop" class="story-band__image" />
      </div>
      <div class="story-band__content">
        <h1>Our Story</h1>
        <p>
          Hello! I'm Jukka-Pekka Lilja, and I am excited to share my journey as a
          passionate luthier and musician! I specialize in crafting folk
          instruments like the jouhikko, igil, doshpuluur, and a variety of
          drums. I invite you to join me on an exhilarating adventure through the
          vibrant sounds of heritage music as we celebrate the incredible
          craftsmanship of these instruments. Whether you're a musician or a
          devoted lover of folk traditions, I can't wait for you to experience
          the enchanting world of handmade instruments at Taidesoitinpaja!
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story-band story-band--plain reveal">
    <div class="container story-band__split">
      <div class="story-band__centered">
        <p>
          I embarked on my journey in the art of instrument building back in 2010
          when I first took the initiative to craft a Bowed Lyre, known as Jouhikko
          in Finnish, specifically for my own personal use and enjoyment. To me,
          instrument making is much more than just a creative pursuit; it involves
          a commitment to ensuring that each piece is not only visually appealing
          but also highly functional. My ultimate goal is to design and create
          distinctive, handcrafted folk instruments that adhere to the highest
          professional standards, ensuring that there is no compromise in quality
          or performance.
        </p>
        <p>
          Since 2010, I have built a variety of different instruments, and with
          each one I complete, I gain a wealth of knowledge. This journey has
          taught me a great deal about acoustics, materials, design, playability,
          and much more. Each instrument is a learning experience that enhances my
          craft and deepens my understanding of what makes an exceptional musical
          tool.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="story-band__image-wrap">
        <Image src={workshopImage} alt="Jukka-Pekka Lilja working on an instrument in the workshop" class="story-band__image" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
   
  .story-band {
    --wood-band-overlay: linear-gradient(oklch(96% .05 85.26 / .55), oklch(90% .04 80 / .35)),
      linear-gradient(#241b140a, #241b142e);
    padding-block: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);
    box-shadow: inset 0 5px 12px #321c0a38, inset 0 -5px 12px #321c0a38;
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding-block: var(--space-5);
  }
  .story-band::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      var(--wood-band-overlay),
      var(--bg-wood);
    transform: scaleX(-1);
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .story-band--plain::before {
    display: none;
  }
  @media (max-width: 799px) {
    .story-band--plain {
      padding-top: var(--space-4);
    }
  }

  .story-band__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (min-width: 800px) {
    .story-band__grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 3fr) minmax(0, 2fr);
      gap: var(--space-5);
    }
  }

  .story-band__image-wrap {
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: clamp(5px, 2vw, 8px) solid #6b4c2e;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgb(0 0 0 / 20%);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .story-band__image-wrap :global(.story-band__image) {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .story-band__content {
    align-self: start;
  }
  .story-band__content h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
    color: var(--color-cream);
    text-shadow:
      -1px -1px 1px oklch(20% 0.02 63 / 0.18),   
       1px  1px 1px oklch(60% 0.03 63 / 0.7);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  .story-band__content p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    font-weight: 600;
    /* color: var(--color-text-muted); */
  }

  .story-band__split {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (min-width: 800px) {
    .story-band__split {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 3fr);
      gap: var(--space-5);
    }
  }

  .story-band__centered {
    max-width: 42rem;
  }
  .story-band__centered h2 {
    color: var(--color-cream);
    text-shadow:
      -1px -1px 1px oklch(20% 0.02 63 / 0.18),   
       1px  1px 1px oklch(60% 0.03 63 / 0.7);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  .story-band__centered p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }
</style>
